  fhir:description [ fhir:v "This value set includes All LOINC codes defined as type \"clinical,\" therefore excluding laboratory tests, survey instruments, and claims documents. This includes observables such as vital signs, hemodynamics, intake/output, EKG, obstetric ultrasound, and cardiac echo, and includes discrete and narrative diagnostic observations and reports."] ; # 
